  "remarks": "TAi.121 Title: Mr. Designation: Third Secretary, Taliban Embassy, Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates (1996-2001). Passport no: Afghanistan passport P02504168, issued in Dubai, United Arab Emirates (Name in Latin script: Azizurahman Abdul Ahad; issued 12 Nov 2019, expires 12 Nov 2029). Afghan identification card (tazkira) number 44323. Belongs to Hotak tribe. Height: 169 cm; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended on 3 Sep 2003, 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov 2011 and 15 Aug 2012, 10 Mar. 2026)",
